---
interface Props {
  id: string;
}
const { id } = Astro.props;
import "../styles/evidence-model.css";
---

<figure class="evidence" id={id} aria-label="Conceptual analysis workflow">
  <ol class="evidence__flow">
    <li>Lineage-tracing data</li>
    <li>Reproducible pattern analysis</li>
    <li>Cross-replicate evaluation</li>
    <li>Hypothesis prioritization</li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption class="evidence__caption">
    The workflow integrates multiple forms of analytical evidence rather than
    relying on a single statistic or sample. Project-specific results are
    intentionally not displayed.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
